WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:06.473
My name is Arturo Fontes.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.743
I was an FBI agent for
approximately 28 years.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:13.178
People laugh at me because
I left sunny San Diego

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.782
with beaches and everything
and a nice big house

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.151
to be in a small
town, in Laredo.

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:19.719
They call it "the
armpit" of Texas.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.669
[honking]

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:39.672
It takes you all
the way into Dallas,

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:42.242
and it even goes all the
way up North in the US.

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.380
Now this is an
area where there

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.517
was the biggest number of trucks
crossing the whole border.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.585
It was a very important route.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.791
The Gulf Cartel was
shipping marijuana,

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:03.096
cocaine, heroin through Texas
to across the United States.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:04.964
The Gulf Cartel was
onto a good thing,

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:07.901
but it was about to get a
whole lot better with the North

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.438
American Free Trade Agreement.

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:13.640
PRESIDENT CLINTON: And after
we'll pare down trade barriers

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.342
between our three
nations, it will create

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.678
the world's largest trade zone.

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:22.749
Today we have the chance to do
what our parents did before us.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.318
We have the opportunity
to remake the world.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.905
ARTURO FONTES: In
Nuevo Laredo, it's

00:01:45.972 --> 00:01:48.508
more important than almost
any other area in Mexico,

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:49.909
and that's why it's
a battleground.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:52.212
It's a crown jewel for drug
trafficking-- everybody

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:53.179
wants that.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.968
MIKE CHAVARRIA: Osiel was a
genius at being able to read

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:51.538
people and manipulate them.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:55.074
He was brilliant at
influencing people to do things

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.809
that they shouldn't be doing.

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.496
In the special
forces, they had

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:19.666
radio code with the zed letter.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.502
So they would have,
like, [speaking spanish]..

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:25.438
They're be like, you
know, Z2, I'm on alert.

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:28.741
They quickly became called
"The Zetas," or "The Zeds,"

00:03:28.808 --> 00:03:29.876
after that radio code.

00:03:34.847 --> 00:03:37.250
MIKE CHAVARRIA: Osiel
saw in them a discipline

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:40.153
that your regular
trafficker did not have,

00:03:40.219 --> 00:03:44.656
and that was a
militarized discipline.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:47.660
A respect for chain
of command, loyalty,

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:51.331
the willing to attack
the hill when told,

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.832
regardless of the outcome.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.113
We saw that the Zetas
were becoming a threat.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.651
There was definitely
a foreboding

00:04:11.718 --> 00:04:14.453
of things to come
as the Zetas began

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.022
to grow and become stronger.

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:19.192
And they were learning the drug
trade from the Gulf Cartel.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:34.440
Osiel is definitely in the
crosshairs of the FBI and DEA.

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:36.376
He is public enemy number one.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.126
[gunfire]

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:58.464
The arrest was like a scene
out of Afghanistan, Iraq.

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:00.733
[gunfire]

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:06.673
The Mexican military
I believe may

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:08.875
have lost one or two
soldiers during the course

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.109
of that gun battle.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.145
[gunfire]

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:16.282
Osiel survived.

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:20.853
He was apprehended, but
it was quite the shootout.

